# ── Downloaded Models (large binaries, not source) ────────────────────
# ── Environment & Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Eradicated Directories (NEVER re-create, NEVER re-track) ────────
# ── External Projects (separate repos, not part of Omega Engine) ──
# ── Generated Context Packs ──────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Grok CLI Config ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Handoff Packets (runtime, not source) ───────────────────────────
# ── IDE & Editor ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Knowledge Hall of Records (session JSON exports, auto-generated) ─
# ── OS Files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Profiling Artifacts (carmack-profiler) ──────────────────────────
# ── Python Bytecode ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Request Queue (runtime artifacts) ───────────────────────────────
# ── Research & Analysis (transient, regenerated per session) ────────
# ── Research/Test Artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Runtime Data (generated at runtime, not source) ────────────────
# ── Session & Coordination (runtime, regenerated per session) ───────
# ── Session Artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Sovereign Key Vault (encrypted API key storage) ─────────────────
# ── Temp & Ad-Hoc Files ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Test & Cache ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Third-Party Reference Repos (never commit) ───────────────────────
# ── Virtual Environments ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# ── Web Research Caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────
